{"$schema":"https://json.schemastore.org/sarif-2.1.0.json","runs":[{"artifacts":[{"contents":{"text":"<scxml xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2005/07/scxml\" version=\"1.0\" datamodel=\"xpath\" initial=\"a\">\n  <datamodel>\n    <data id=\"count\" expr=\"0\"/>\n    <data id=\"done\" expr=\"false()\"/>\n  </datamodel>\n  <state id=\"a\">\n    <transition event=\"e1\" cond=\"$count = 1 || $done\" target=\"b\"/>\n    <transition event=\"e2\" cond=\"$count % 2 = 0\" target=\"b\"/>\n    <transition event=\"e3\" cond=\"$count AND $done\" target=\"b\"/>\n    <transition event=\"e4\" cond=\"fn:concat('a', 'b') = 'ab'\" target=\"b\"/>\n    <transition event=\"e5\" cond=\"contains('a')\" target=\"b\"/>\n    <transition event=\"e6\" cond=\"$count = 'open\" target=\"b\"/>\n    <transition event=\"e7\" cond=\"$ count = 1\" target=\"b\"/>\n    <transition event=\"e8\" cond=\"$count/sideways::x\" target=\"b\"/>\n    <transition event=\"e9\" cond=\"$count/@\" target=\"b\"/>\n    <transition event=\"e10\" cond=\"$done ? 1 : 0\" target=\"b\"/>\n    <transition event=\"e11\" cond=\"$count === 3\" target=\"b\"/>\n    <transition event=\"e12\" cond=\"$count = 1;\" target=\"b\"/>\n    <transition event=\"e13\" cond=\"$count[1 = 1\" target=\"b\"/>\n    <transition event=\"e14\" cond=\"$count &gt;\" target=\"b\"/>\n    <transition event=\"e15\" cond=\"$count = 1 and not $done\" target=\"b\"/>\n    <transition event=\"e16\" cond=\"cuont($count) = 1\" target=\"b\"/>\n    <transition event=\"e17\" cond=\"!($done or $count = 1)\" target=\"b\"/>\n    <transition event=\"e18\" cond=\"$count = 1 $done\" target=\"b\"/>\n  </state>\n  <final id=\"b\"/>\n</scxml>\n"},"location":{"uri":"tests/ui/scxml038-xpath-syntax-paths.scxml"},"mimeType":"application/scxml+xml"}],"columnKind":"utf16CodeUnits","properties":{"diagnosticCounts":{"errors":0,"notes":0,"total":18,"warnings":18},"producer":{"kind":"validator"}},"results":[{"fixes":[{"artifactChanges":[{"artifactLocation":{"uri":"tests/ui/scxml038-xpath-syntax-paths.scxml"},"replacements":[{"deletedRegion":{"byteLength":2,"byteOffset":251,"endColumn":47,"endLine":7,"startColumn":45,"startLine":7},"insertedContent":{"text":"or"}}]}],"description":{"text":"use `or`"},"properties":{"applicability":"machine-applicable"}}],"level":"warning","locations":[{"physicalLocation":{"artifactLocation":{"uri":"tests/ui/scxml038-xpath-syntax-paths.scxml"},"region":{"endColumn":47,"endLine":7,"startColumn":45,"startLine":7}}}],"message":{"markdown":"xpath syntax error in `cond`: `||` is not an XPath operator\n\n**Note:** a condition that cannot be parsed raises `error.execution` and evaluates as false, so this condition can never hold\n\n**Help:** XPath spells logical or as `or`; a single `|` is the node-set union\n\n**Spec:** SCXML 1.0 §5.9 Expressions\n\n**Spec:** SCXML CR 2014 §C.3 The XPath Data Model","text":"xpath syntax error in `cond`: `||` is not an XPath operator"},"properties":{"byteSpan":{"end":253,"start":251},"category":"lint"},"relatedLocations":[{"id":1,"message":{"text":"while parsing this `cond`"},"physicalLocation":{"artifactLocation":{"uri":"tests/ui/scxml038-xpath-syntax-paths.scxml"},"region":{"endColumn":53,"endLine":7,"startColumn":34,"startLine":7}}}],"ruleId":"SCXML038"},{"fixes":[{"artifactChanges":[{"artifactLocation":{"uri":"tests/ui/scxml038-xpath-syntax-paths.scxml"},"replacements":[{"deletedRegion":{"byteLength":1,"byteOffset":314,"endColumn":42,"endLine":8,"startColumn":41,"startLine":8},"insertedContent":{"text":"mod"}}]}],"description":{"text":"use `mod`"},"properties":{"applicability":"machine-applicable"}}],"level":"warning","locations":[{"physicalLocation":{"artifactLocation":{"uri":"tests/ui/scxml038-xpath-syntax-paths.scxml"},"region":{"endColumn":42,"endLine":8,"startColumn":41,"startLine":8}}}],"message":{"markdown":"xpath syntax error in `cond`: `%` is not an XPath operator\n\n**Note:** a condition that cannot be parsed raises `error.execution` and evaluates as false, so this condition can never hold\n\n**Help:** XPath spells the remainder operator `mod`\n\n**Spec:** SCXML 1.0 §5.9 Expressions\n\n**Spec:** SCXML CR 2014 §C.3 The XPath Data Model","text":"xpath syntax error in `cond`: `%` is not an XPath operator"},"properties":{"byteSpan":{"end":315,"start":314},"category":"lint"},"relatedLocations":[{"id":1,"message":{"text":"while parsing this `cond`"},"physicalLocation":{"artifactLocation":{"uri":"tests/ui/scxml038-xpath-syntax-paths.scxml"},"region":{"endColumn":48,"endLine":8,"startColumn":34,"startLine":8}}}],"ruleId":"SCXML038"},{"fixes":[{"artifactChanges":[{"artifactLocation":{"uri":"tests/ui/scxml038-xpath-syntax-paths.scxml"},"replacements":[{"deletedRegion":{"byteLength":3,"byteOffset":376,"endColumn":44,"endLine":9,"startColumn":41,"startLine":9},"insertedContent":{"text":"and"}}]}],"description":{"text":"use `and`"},"properties":{"applicability":"machine-applicable"}}],"level":"warning","locations":[{"physicalLocation":{"artifactLocation":{"uri":"tests/ui/scxml038-xpath-syntax-paths.scxml"},"region":{"endColumn":44,"endLine":9,"startColumn":41,"startLine":9}}}],"message":{"markdown":"xpath syntax error in `cond`: XPath operators are lowercase: `AND` is not an operator\n\n**Note:** a condition that cannot be parsed raises `error.execution` and evaluates as false, so this condition can never hold\n\n**Help:** write `and`\n\n**Spec:** SCXML 1.0 §5.9 Expressions\n\n**Spec:** SCXML CR 2014 §C.3 The XPath Data Model","text":"xpath syntax error in `cond`: XPath operators are lowercase: `AND` is not an operator"},"properties":{"byteSpan":{"end":379,"start":376},"category":"lint"},"relatedLocations":[{"id":1,"message":{"text":"while parsing this `cond`"},"physicalLocation":{"artifactLocation":{"uri":"tests/ui/scxml038-xpath-syntax-paths.scxml"},"region":{"endColumn":50,"endLine":9,"startColumn":34,"startLine":9}}}],"ruleId":"SCXML038"},{"fixes":[{"artifactChanges":[{"artifactLocation":{"uri":"tests/ui/scxml038-xpath-syntax-paths.scxml"},"replacements":[{"deletedRegion":{"byteLength":9,"byteOffset":433,"endColumn":43,"endLine":10,"startColumn":34,"startLine":10},"insertedContent":{"text":"concat"}}]}],"description":{"text":"call `concat()` without the prefix"},"properties":{"applicability":"maybe-incorrect"}}],"level":"warning","locations":[{"physicalLocation":{"artifactLocation":{"uri":"tests/ui/scxml038-xpath-syntax-paths.scxml"},"region":{"endColumn":43,"endLine":10,"startColumn":34,"startLine":10}}}],"message":{"markdown":"xpath syntax error in `cond`: namespace prefix `fn` is not declared\n\n**Note:** a condition that cannot be parsed raises `error.execution` and evaluates as false, so this condition can never hold\n\n**Help:** `concat()` is an XPath 1.0 core function; call it without a prefix\n\n**Spec:** SCXML 1.0 §5.9 Expressions\n\n**Spec:** SCXML CR 2014 §C.3 The XPath Data Model","text":"xpath syntax error in `cond`: namespace prefix `fn` is not declared"},"properties":{"byteSpan":{"end":442,"start":433},"category":"lint"},"relatedLocations":[{"id":1,"message":{"text":"while parsing this `cond`"},"physicalLocation":{"artifactLocation":{"uri":"tests/ui/scxml038-xpath-syntax-paths.scxml"},"region":{"endColumn":60,"endLine":10,"startColumn":34,"startLine":10}}}],"ruleId":"SCXML038"},{"level":"warning","locations":[{"physicalLocation":{"artifactLocation":{"uri":"tests/ui/scxml038-xpath-syntax-paths.scxml"},"region":{"endColumn":42,"endLine":11,"startColumn":34,"startLine":11}}}],"message":{"markdown":"xpath syntax error in `cond`: wrong number of arguments to `contains()`\n\n**Note:** a condition that cannot be parsed raises `error.execution` and evaluates as false, so this condition can never hold\n\n**Help:** `contains()` takes exactly 2 arguments\n\n**Spec:** SCXML 1.0 §5.9 Expressions\n\n**Spec:** SCXML CR 2014 §C.3 The XPath Data Model","text":"xpath syntax error in `cond`: wrong number of arguments to `contains()`"},"properties":{"byteSpan":{"end":515,"start":507},"category":"lint"},"relatedLocations":[{"id":1,"message":{"text":"while parsing this `cond`"},"physicalLocation":{"artifactLocation":{"uri":"tests/ui/scxml038-xpath-syntax-paths.scxml"},"region":{"endColumn":47,"endLine":11,"startColumn":34,"startLine":11}}}],"ruleId":"SCXML038"},{"level":"warning","locations":[{"physicalLocation":{"artifactLocation":{"uri":"tests/ui/scxml038-xpath-syntax-paths.scxml"},"region":{"endColumn":44,"endLine":12,"startColumn":43,"startLine":12}}}],"message":{"markdown":"xpath syntax error in `cond`: unterminated string literal\n\n**Note:** a condition that cannot be parsed raises `error.execution` and evaluates as false, so this condition can never hold\n\n**Help:** close the string with a matching `'`; XPath 1.0 string literals have no escape sequences\n\n**Spec:** SCXML 1.0 §5.9 Expressions\n\n**Spec:** SCXML CR 2014 §C.3 The XPath Data Model","text":"xpath syntax error in `cond`: unterminated string literal"},"properties":{"byteSpan":{"end":578,"start":577},"category":"lint"},"relatedLocations":[{"id":1,"message":{"text":"while parsing this `cond`"},"physicalLocation":{"artifactLocation":{"uri":"tests/ui/scxml038-xpath-syntax-paths.scxml"},"region":{"endColumn":48,"endLine":12,"startColumn":34,"startLine":12}}}],"ruleId":"SCXML038"},{"level":"warning","locations":[{"physicalLocation":{"artifactLocation":{"uri":"tests/ui/scxml038-xpath-syntax-paths.scxml"},"region":{"endColumn":35,"endLine":13,"startColumn":34,"startLine":13}}}],"message":{"markdown":"xpath syntax error in `cond`: `$` must be followed by a variable name\n\n**Note:** a condition that cannot be parsed raises `error.execution` and evaluates as false, so this condition can never hold\n\n**Help:** write the variable name directly after `$`, for example `$count`\n\n**Spec:** SCXML 1.0 §5.9 Expressions\n\n**Spec:** SCXML CR 2014 §C.3 The XPath Data Model","text":"xpath syntax error in `cond`: `$` must be followed by a variable name"},"properties":{"byteSpan":{"end":631,"start":630},"category":"lint"},"relatedLocations":[{"id":1,"message":{"text":"while parsing this `cond`"},"physicalLocation":{"artifactLocation":{"uri":"tests/ui/scxml038-xpath-syntax-paths.scxml"},"region":{"endColumn":45,"endLine":13,"startColumn":34,"startLine":13}}}],"ruleId":"SCXML038"},{"level":"warning","locations":[{"physicalLocation":{"artifactLocation":{"uri":"tests/ui/scxml038-xpath-syntax-paths.scxml"},"region":{"endColumn":49,"endLine":14,"startColumn":41,"startLine":14}}}],"message":{"markdown":"xpath syntax error in `cond`: unknown XPath axis `sideways`\n\n**Note:** a condition that cannot be parsed raises `error.execution` and evaluates as false, so this condition can never hold\n\n**Help:** XPath 1.0 axes are `ancestor`, `ancestor-or-self`, `attribute`, `child`, `descendant`, `descendant-or-self`, `following`, `following-sibling`, `namespace`, `parent`, `preceding`, `preceding-sibling`, and `self`\n\n**Spec:** SCXML 1.0 §5.9 Expressions\n\n**Spec:** SCXML CR 2014 §C.3 The XPath Data Model","text":"xpath syntax error in `cond`: unknown XPath axis `sideways`"},"properties":{"byteSpan":{"end":704,"start":696},"category":"lint"},"relatedLocations":[{"id":1,"message":{"text":"while parsing this `cond`"},"physicalLocation":{"artifactLocation":{"uri":"tests/ui/scxml038-xpath-syntax-paths.scxml"},"region":{"endColumn":52,"endLine":14,"startColumn":34,"startLine":14}}}],"ruleId":"SCXML038"},{"level":"warning","locations":[{"physicalLocation":{"artifactLocation":{"uri":"tests/ui/scxml038-xpath-syntax-paths.scxml"},"region":{"endColumn":42,"endLine":15,"startColumn":41,"startLine":15}}}],"message":{"markdown":"xpath syntax error in `cond`: expected a node test (a name, `*`, `text()`, or `node()`), found the end of the expression\n\n**Note:** a condition that cannot be parsed raises `error.execution` and evaluates as false, so this condition can never hold\n\n**Help:** each step of a location path must name what it selects, for example `$order/item` or `$order/*`\n\n**Spec:** SCXML 1.0 §5.9 Expressions\n\n**Spec:** SCXML CR 2014 §C.3 The XPath Data Model","text":"xpath syntax error in `cond`: expected a node test (a name, `*`, `text()`, or `node()`), found the end of the expression"},"properties":{"byteSpan":{"end":763,"start":762},"category":"lint"},"relatedLocations":[{"id":1,"message":{"text":"while parsing this `cond`"},"physicalLocation":{"artifactLocation":{"uri":"tests/ui/scxml038-xpath-syntax-paths.scxml"},"region":{"endColumn":42,"endLine":15,"startColumn":34,"startLine":15}}}],"ruleId":"SCXML038"},{"level":"warning","locations":[{"physicalLocation":{"artifactLocation":{"uri":"tests/ui/scxml038-xpath-syntax-paths.scxml"},"region":{"endColumn":42,"endLine":16,"startColumn":41,"startLine":16}}}],"message":{"markdown":"xpath syntax error in `cond`: `?` is not an XPath operator\n\n**Note:** a condition that cannot be parsed raises `error.execution` and evaluates as false, so this condition can never hold\n\n**Help:** XPath 1.0 has no `?:` conditional; split the logic into `<if>`/`<else>` branches\n\n**Spec:** SCXML 1.0 §5.9 Expressions\n\n**Spec:** SCXML CR 2014 §C.3 The XPath Data Model","text":"xpath syntax error in `cond`: `?` is not an XPath operator"},"properties":{"byteSpan":{"end":819,"start":818},"category":"lint"},"relatedLocations":[{"id":1,"message":{"text":"while parsing this `cond`"},"physicalLocation":{"artifactLocation":{"uri":"tests/ui/scxml038-xpath-syntax-paths.scxml"},"region":{"endColumn":48,"endLine":16,"startColumn":35,"startLine":16}}}],"ruleId":"SCXML038"},{"fixes":[{"artifactChanges":[{"artifactLocation":{"uri":"tests/ui/scxml038-xpath-syntax-paths.scxml"},"replacements":[{"deletedRegion":{"byteLength":3,"byteOffset":881,"endColumn":45,"endLine":17,"startColumn":42,"startLine":17},"insertedContent":{"text":"="}}]}],"description":{"text":"compare with `=`"},"properties":{"applicability":"machine-applicable"}}],"level":"warning","locations":[{"physicalLocation":{"artifactLocation":{"uri":"tests/ui/scxml038-xpath-syntax-paths.scxml"},"region":{"endColumn":45,"endLine":17,"startColumn":42,"startLine":17}}}],"message":{"markdown":"xpath syntax error in `cond`: `===` is not an XPath operator\n\n**Note:** a condition that cannot be parsed raises `error.execution` and evaluates as false, so this condition can never hold\n\n**Help:** XPath compares with a single `=` (and `!=` for inequality)\n\n**Spec:** SCXML 1.0 §5.9 Expressions\n\n**Spec:** SCXML CR 2014 §C.3 The XPath Data Model","text":"xpath syntax error in `cond`: `===` is not an XPath operator"},"properties":{"byteSpan":{"end":884,"start":881},"category":"lint"},"relatedLocations":[{"id":1,"message":{"text":"while parsing this `cond`"},"physicalLocation":{"artifactLocation":{"uri":"tests/ui/scxml038-xpath-syntax-paths.scxml"},"region":{"endColumn":47,"endLine":17,"startColumn":35,"startLine":17}}}],"ruleId":"SCXML038"},{"fixes":[{"artifactChanges":[{"artifactLocation":{"uri":"tests/ui/scxml038-xpath-syntax-paths.scxml"},"replacements":[{"deletedRegion":{"byteLength":1,"byteOffset":945,"endColumn":46,"endLine":18,"startColumn":45,"startLine":18},"insertedContent":{"text":""}}]}],"description":{"text":"remove the `;`"},"properties":{"applicability":"maybe-incorrect"}}],"level":"warning","locations":[{"physicalLocation":{"artifactLocation":{"uri":"tests/ui/scxml038-xpath-syntax-paths.scxml"},"region":{"endColumn":46,"endLine":18,"startColumn":45,"startLine":18}}}],"message":{"markdown":"xpath syntax error in `cond`: `;` cannot end an XPath expression\n\n**Note:** a condition that cannot be parsed raises `error.execution` and evaluates as false, so this condition can never hold\n\n**Help:** an XPath expression is not a statement: remove the `;`\n\n**Spec:** SCXML 1.0 §5.9 Expressions\n\n**Spec:** SCXML CR 2014 §C.3 The XPath Data Model","text":"xpath syntax error in `cond`: `;` cannot end an XPath expression"},"properties":{"byteSpan":{"end":946,"start":945},"category":"lint"},"relatedLocations":[{"id":1,"message":{"text":"while parsing this `cond`"},"physicalLocation":{"artifactLocation":{"uri":"tests/ui/scxml038-xpath-syntax-paths.scxml"},"region":{"endColumn":46,"endLine":18,"startColumn":35,"startLine":18}}}],"ruleId":"SCXML038"},{"level":"warning","locations":[{"physicalLocation":{"artifactLocation":{"uri":"tests/ui/scxml038-xpath-syntax-paths.scxml"},"region":{"endColumn":47,"endLine":19,"startColumn":46,"startLine":19}}}],"message":{"markdown":"xpath syntax error in `cond`: expected `]` to close the predicate, found the end of the expression\n\n**Note:** a condition that cannot be parsed raises `error.execution` and evaluates as false, so this condition can never hold\n\n**Help:** add the missing `]` where the predicate ends\n\n**Spec:** SCXML 1.0 §5.9 Expressions\n\n**Spec:** SCXML CR 2014 §C.3 The XPath Data Model","text":"xpath syntax error in `cond`: expected `]` to close the predicate, found the end of the expression"},"properties":{"byteSpan":{"end":1007,"start":1006},"category":"lint"},"relatedLocations":[{"id":1,"message":{"text":"while parsing this `cond`"},"physicalLocation":{"artifactLocation":{"uri":"tests/ui/scxml038-xpath-syntax-paths.scxml"},"region":{"endColumn":47,"endLine":19,"startColumn":35,"startLine":19}}},{"id":2,"message":{"text":"this `[` is never closed"},"physicalLocation":{"artifactLocation":{"uri":"tests/ui/scxml038-xpath-syntax-paths.scxml"},"region":{"endColumn":42,"endLine":19,"startColumn":41,"startLine":19}}}],"ruleId":"SCXML038"},{"level":"warning","locations":[{"physicalLocation":{"artifactLocation":{"uri":"tests/ui/scxml038-xpath-syntax-paths.scxml"},"region":{"endColumn":46,"endLine":20,"startColumn":42,"startLine":20}}}],"message":{"markdown":"xpath syntax error in `cond`: the expression ends before it is complete\n\n**Note:** a condition that cannot be parsed raises `error.execution` and evaluates as false, so this condition can never hold\n\n**Help:** add the missing operand after the last operator\n\n**Spec:** SCXML 1.0 §5.9 Expressions\n\n**Spec:** SCXML CR 2014 §C.3 The XPath Data Model","text":"xpath syntax error in `cond`: the expression ends before it is complete"},"properties":{"byteSpan":{"end":1067,"start":1063},"category":"lint"},"relatedLocations":[{"id":1,"message":{"text":"while parsing this `cond`"},"physicalLocation":{"artifactLocation":{"uri":"tests/ui/scxml038-xpath-syntax-paths.scxml"},"region":{"endColumn":46,"endLine":20,"startColumn":35,"startLine":20}}}],"ruleId":"SCXML038"},{"fixes":[{"artifactChanges":[{"artifactLocation":{"uri":"tests/ui/scxml038-xpath-syntax-paths.scxml"},"replacements":[{"deletedRegion":{"byteLength":4,"byteOffset":1131,"endColumn":54,"endLine":21,"startColumn":50,"startLine":21},"insertedContent":{"text":"not("}},{"deletedRegion":{"byteLength":0,"byteOffset":1140,"endColumn":59,"endLine":21,"startColumn":59,"startLine":21},"insertedContent":{"text":")"}}]}],"description":{"text":"call `not()` with parentheses"},"properties":{"applicability":"maybe-incorrect"}}],"level":"warning","locations":[{"physicalLocation":{"artifactLocation":{"uri":"tests/ui/scxml038-xpath-syntax-paths.scxml"},"region":{"endColumn":53,"endLine":21,"startColumn":50,"startLine":21}}}],"message":{"markdown":"xpath syntax error in `cond`: `not` is a function in XPath, not an operator\n\n**Note:** a condition that cannot be parsed raises `error.execution` and evaluates as false, so this condition can never hold\n\n**Help:** call it with parentheses, for example `not($done)`\n\n**Spec:** SCXML 1.0 §5.9 Expressions\n\n**Spec:** SCXML CR 2014 §C.3 The XPath Data Model","text":"xpath syntax error in `cond`: `not` is a function in XPath, not an operator"},"properties":{"byteSpan":{"end":1134,"start":1131},"category":"lint"},"relatedLocations":[{"id":1,"message":{"text":"while parsing this `cond`"},"physicalLocation":{"artifactLocation":{"uri":"tests/ui/scxml038-xpath-syntax-paths.scxml"},"region":{"endColumn":59,"endLine":21,"startColumn":35,"startLine":21}}}],"ruleId":"SCXML038"},{"fixes":[{"artifactChanges":[{"artifactLocation":{"uri":"tests/ui/scxml038-xpath-syntax-paths.scxml"},"replacements":[{"deletedRegion":{"byteLength":5,"byteOffset":1189,"endColumn":40,"endLine":22,"startColumn":35,"startLine":22},"insertedContent":{"text":"count"}}]}],"description":{"text":"use `count()`"},"properties":{"applicability":"maybe-incorrect"}}],"level":"warning","locations":[{"physicalLocation":{"artifactLocation":{"uri":"tests/ui/scxml038-xpath-syntax-paths.scxml"},"region":{"endColumn":40,"endLine":22,"startColumn":35,"startLine":22}}}],"message":{"markdown":"xpath syntax error in `cond`: unknown XPath function `cuont()`\n\n**Note:** a condition that cannot be parsed raises `error.execution` and evaluates as false, so this condition can never hold\n\n**Help:** did you mean `count()`?\n\n**Spec:** SCXML 1.0 §5.9 Expressions\n\n**Spec:** SCXML CR 2014 §C.3 The XPath Data Model","text":"xpath syntax error in `cond`: unknown XPath function `cuont()`"},"properties":{"byteSpan":{"end":1194,"start":1189},"category":"lint"},"relatedLocations":[{"id":1,"message":{"text":"while parsing this `cond`"},"physicalLocation":{"artifactLocation":{"uri":"tests/ui/scxml038-xpath-syntax-paths.scxml"},"region":{"endColumn":52,"endLine":22,"startColumn":35,"startLine":22}}}],"ruleId":"SCXML038"},{"fixes":[{"artifactChanges":[{"artifactLocation":{"uri":"tests/ui/scxml038-xpath-syntax-paths.scxml"},"replacements":[{"deletedRegion":{"byteLength":1,"byteOffset":1255,"endColumn":36,"endLine":23,"startColumn":35,"startLine":23},"insertedContent":{"text":"not"}}]}],"description":{"text":"negate with `not()`"},"properties":{"applicability":"maybe-incorrect"}}],"level":"warning","locations":[{"physicalLocation":{"artifactLocation":{"uri":"tests/ui/scxml038-xpath-syntax-paths.scxml"},"region":{"endColumn":36,"endLine":23,"startColumn":35,"startLine":23}}}],"message":{"markdown":"xpath syntax error in `cond`: `!` is not an XPath operator\n\n**Note:** a condition that cannot be parsed raises `error.execution` and evaluates as false, so this condition can never hold\n\n**Help:** negate with the `not()` function, for example `not($done)`; `!=` is the only XPath operator with `!`\n\n**Spec:** SCXML 1.0 §5.9 Expressions\n\n**Spec:** SCXML CR 2014 §C.3 The XPath Data Model","text":"xpath syntax error in `cond`: `!` is not an XPath operator"},"properties":{"byteSpan":{"end":1256,"start":1255},"category":"lint"},"relatedLocations":[{"id":1,"message":{"text":"while parsing this `cond`"},"physicalLocation":{"artifactLocation":{"uri":"tests/ui/scxml038-xpath-syntax-paths.scxml"},"region":{"endColumn":57,"endLine":23,"startColumn":35,"startLine":23}}}],"ruleId":"SCXML038"},{"level":"warning","locations":[{"physicalLocation":{"artifactLocation":{"uri":"tests/ui/scxml038-xpath-syntax-paths.scxml"},"region":{"endColumn":51,"endLine":24,"startColumn":46,"startLine":24}}}],"message":{"markdown":"xpath syntax error in `cond`: unexpected `$done` after a complete expression\n\n**Note:** a condition that cannot be parsed raises `error.execution` and evaluates as false, so this condition can never hold\n\n**Help:** two expressions follow each other with no operator between them: join them with an operator such as `and`, `or`, `=`, or `+`, or quote text as a string literal\n\n**Spec:** SCXML 1.0 §5.9 Expressions\n\n**Spec:** SCXML CR 2014 §C.3 The XPath Data Model","text":"xpath syntax error in `cond`: unexpected `$done` after a complete expression"},"properties":{"byteSpan":{"end":1342,"start":1337},"category":"lint"},"relatedLocations":[{"id":1,"message":{"text":"while parsing this `cond`"},"physicalLocation":{"artifactLocation":{"uri":"tests/ui/scxml038-xpath-syntax-paths.scxml"},"region":{"endColumn":51,"endLine":24,"startColumn":35,"startLine":24}}}],"ruleId":"SCXML038"}],"tool":{"driver":{"informationUri":"https://www.w3.org/TR/scxml/","name":"scxml-validator","rules":[{"defaultConfiguration":{"level":"warning"},"fullDescription":{"text":"SCXML 1.0 §5.9.4: \"The SCXML Processor MAY reject documents containing syntactically ill-formed expressions at document load time, or it MAY wait and place 'error.execution' in the internal event queue at runtime when the expressions are evaluated.\" This toolchain takes the second option, so the document compiles and the expression raises `error.execution` whenever it is evaluated (a condition is then false and the rest of an executable-content block is skipped); this check runs only when the host supplies the data model's parse-only syntax capability (the native CLI links the ECMAScript and XPath checkers). Each finding names the offending source text and, where a repair is certain to parse, offers it: ECMAScript habits in XPath (`==` to `=`, `&&` to `and`, `||` to `or`, `!x` to `not(x)`, `length()` to `string-length()`), a stray `=` in ECMAScript (`x === = 3`), word operators, quoting, and more. The XPath data model has no script language, so a non-empty `<script>` is reported too"},"help":{"text":"How to fix: apply the suggested repair, or fix the syntax at the marked position following the finding's help; for XPath, use XPath 1.0 operators and functions (`=`, `and`, `or`, `not()`, `string-length()`, `count()`).\n\nSpecification: SCXML 1.0 §B.2 The ECMAScript Data Model\n\nRun `scxml-cli --explain SCXML038` for examples."},"helpUri":"https://www.w3.org/TR/scxml/#ecma-profile","id":"SCXML038","name":"SCXML038","properties":{"category":"semantic"},"shortDescription":{"text":"an expression or script does not parse in the selected data model"}}],"semanticVersion":"0.2.0"}}}],"version":"2.1.0"}